      "statement": "streamPapers in store.ts reads papers in batches of PAPER_BATCH = 250 (small so the progress count keeps moving), appends each batch to project.papers and to every undo/redo snapshot, updates loadProgress, and yields to the event loop between batches so the UI renders; when the last batch lands loadState becomes 'ready' and the PDF folder scan starts.",
