    {
      "id": "claim_f1f7859810ab4f6eb17567429756defd",
      "statement": "Project loading work runs off the main thread: offMain posts a job (open, read, head or parse) to projectJobs.worker.ts, which runs runJob; TauriAdapter uses open/read to assemble raw split files with the assembler from assemble.ts, and DesktopAdapter uses head/parse to run loadProject and parse each batch, passing the head result to the store as OpenedProject.project so it is not reparsed. offMain runs the job inline where Worker is undefined (vitest/jsdom), and a read for an unknown session throws 'The project is no longer open.'",
